        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet wave of break-ins has begun spreading through small towns. No signs of forced entry, no alarms triggered - only missing valuables and a strange symbols left behind. Locals have started to notice the pattern: a rat graffities near the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Rat’s Contracts</i></strong> is a first-person stealth game about precision, patience, and disappearing without a trace.  There are no weapons and no chaos - only careful movement and calculated execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/bd264dd62fcd7feff6f1967ccea7ae8d.avif?t=1771867969\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/31b0ffb73ac64b252b25e10753a9eaae.poster.avif?t=1771867969\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/31b0ffb73ac64b252b25e10753a9eaae.webm?t=1771867969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/31b0ffb73ac64b252b25e10753a9eaae.mp4?t=1771867969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>non-linear</strong> world with multiple paths. Interact with the environment and choose your own way to complete each mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/769971ae6b2a6bc3960cd866d76ce7cf.avif?t=1771867969\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/c62d8d215d3a96701ae321c734d2c662.poster.avif?t=1771867969\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/c62d8d215d3a96701ae321c734d2c662.webm?t=1771867969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/c62d8d215d3a96701ae321c734d2c662.mp4?t=1771867969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Avoid or neutralize local residents. Use stealth to stay out of sight and outsmart advanced NPCs with dynamic vision and hearing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/587953843b4cd54763dcc0bab8ed8487.avif?t=1771867969\" width=800 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/cfc57bda4e4423eba9a68e2e3df93f5a.poster.avif?t=1771867969\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/cfc57bda4e4423eba9a68e2e3df93f5a.webm?t=1771867969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/cfc57bda4e4423eba9a68e2e3df93f5a.mp4?t=1771867969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The environments are filled with <strong>hidden traps and friendly creatures</strong>. Observe your surroundings, anticipate threats, and move forward with caution. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/ee46436583ecb1813810b92912c7ba7c.avif?t=1771867969\" width=800 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/7b780ec5497f1e18e4c49ac7912a5ce8.poster.avif?t=1771867969\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/7b780ec5497f1e18e4c49ac7912a5ce8.webm?t=1771867969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/7b780ec5497f1e18e4c49ac7912a5ce8.mp4?t=1771867969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A Variety of <strong>objectives</strong> will test your flexibility and strategic thinking.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/b1b2642189d1ad3aeccfb0b1d8fcea7f.avif?t=1771867969\" width=800 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/0d4a20eb4acc3866b3afbeeeb7bf764d.poster.avif?t=1771867969\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/0d4a20eb4acc3866b3afbeeeb7bf764d.webm?t=1771867969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/0d4a20eb4acc3866b3afbeeeb7bf764d.mp4?t=1771867969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s always a <strong>faster way</strong> - discover it and prove your skills against others in the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet wave of break-ins has begun spreading through small towns. No signs of forced entry, no alarms triggered - only missing valuables and a strange symbols left behind. Locals have started to notice the pattern: a rat graffities near the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Rat’s Contracts</i></strong> is a first-person stealth game about precision, patience, and disappearing without a trace.  There are no weapons and no chaos - only careful movement and calculated execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/bd264dd62fcd7feff6f1967ccea7ae8d.avif?t=1771867969\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/31b0ffb73ac64b252b25e10753a9eaae.poster.avif?t=1771867969\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/31b0ffb73ac64b252b25e10753a9eaae.webm?t=1771867969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/31b0ffb73ac64b252b25e10753a9eaae.mp4?t=1771867969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>non-linear</strong> world with multiple paths. Interact with the environment and choose your own way to complete each mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/769971ae6b2a6bc3960cd866d76ce7cf.avif?t=1771867969\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" sty