.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/ee46436583ecb1813810b92912c7ba7c.avif?t=1771867969\" width=800 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/7b780ec5497f1e18e4c49ac7912a5ce8.poster.avif?t=1771867969\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/7b780ec5497f1e18e4c49ac7912a5ce8.webm?t=1771867969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/7b780ec5497f1e18e4c49ac7912a5ce8.mp4?t=1771867969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A Variety of <strong>objectives</strong> will test your flexibility and strategic thinking.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/b1b2642189d1ad3aeccfb0b1d8fcea7f.avif?t=1771867969\" width=800 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/0d4a20eb4acc3866b3afbeeeb7bf764d.poster.avif?t=1771867969\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/0d4a20eb4acc3866b3afbeeeb7bf764d.webm?t=1771867969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660130/extras/0d4a20eb4acc3866b3afbeeeb7bf764d.mp4?t=1771867969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s always a <strong>faster way</strong> - discover it and prove your skills against others in the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
